ransfers sent","title":"Share and receive limitless"},"recovery":{"description":"Never be afraid of losing your files","title":"Recover expired transfers"}},"bundle_page_cta":"Explore all %{appCount} products","claim":{"products":{"evernote":{"description":"Keep notes, docs and tasks in one place, synced across all your devices."},"harvest":{"description":"Track time across projects and turn it into invoices."},"vimeo":{"description":"Host and share your videos in up to 8K, with no weekly upload limits."}},"subtitle_with_remaining":"Your codes for %{products} and %{remainingProductCount} more apps are ready.","subtitle_without_remaining":"Your codes for %{products} are ready.","title":"Your Ultimate plan just got %{appCount} apps bigger!"},"hero":{"apps_included":"%{appCount} apps, included","claim_cta":"Claim your apps","description_with_remaining":"%{products} and %{remainingProductCount} more apps. Grab your codes on the bundle page.","description_without_remaining":"Your plan includes %{products}. Grab your codes on the bundle page."},"redeem":"Open %{app} to redeem","section_label":"AND MUCH MORE! LIKE..."},"cancel_unpaid_invoice":{"acknowledgement":"I understand my plan will be cancelled immediately, my account will be downgraded to the Free plan, and that a payment already being processed may still complete. If it does, I can contact support for a refund.","cta":"Cancel plan & stop payment","description":{"account_details":"You\'re logged into the <bold>%{email}</bold> account. Your current plan is <bold>%{currentTier}</bold>.","policy":"Your last renewal payment didn\'t go through, so we\'re still trying to collect it. You can cancel your plan now. This will downgrade the account to the Free plan, void the outstanding invoice, and stop any further payment attempts.","policy_with_next_retry":"Your last renewal payment didn\'t go through, so we\'re still trying to collect it. The next attempt is on <bold>%{nextRetryAt}</bold>. You can cancel your plan now. This will downgrade the account to the Free plan, void the outstanding invoice, and stop any further payment attempts."},"error":{"freeAccount":"This account is currently on a Free plan. Please log in to the account associated with your paid plan.","noUnpaidInvoice":"We couldn\'t find an unpaid payment to stop. If you believe this is an error, please <customerSupport>contact our support chat</customerSupport>.","notYourTeam":"Only the owner of the team can cancel this payment. Please contact the owner to proceed.","subscriptionNotCancelable":"This subscription can no longer be cancelled through this page. Please contact support via <customerSupport>this form</customerSupport>.","unknown":"Something went wrong. Please contact support via <customerSupport>this form</customerSupport> for more information.","unsupportedProvider":"This plan isn\'t eligible for this option. Please contact support via <customerSupport>this form</customerSupport> for more information."},"go_home":"Go to homepage","processing":"Processing...","submitted":"Your plan has been cancelled and we\'ve stopped collecting the outstanding payment.","title":"Cancel plan & stop payment"},"checkout":{"billing":{"monthly":"month","weekly":"week","yearly":"year"},"bundle-upsell":{"billing_period":{"monthly":"month","weekly":"week","yearly":"year"},"bundle_value":"Worth up to %{value} in value","cta":{"primary":"Get the bundle","secondary":"Continue with just Ultimate"},"description":"Add %{products} and %{remainingProductCount} more premium tools to your plan — for less than the price of any one of them.","description-no-remaining":"Add %{products} to your plan — for less than the price of any one of them.","disclaimer":"By clicking on \\"Get the bundle\\", you are entering into an <b>auto-renewing subscription</b>. Today, we will charge you <b>%{introPrice}</b> as an introductory offer. Starting <b>%{startDate}</b>, your Ultimate subscription + Bundle will automatically renew at <b>%{renewalPrice} per %{periodicity}</b>, until you cancel. You can do so any time in your account billing settings.","offer-terms":"Offer subject to <0>conditions</0>.","offer-terms-link":"conditions","price":{"per_month":"per month","per_week":"per week","per_year":"per year"},"title":"%{productCount} apps. One add-on."},"compliant-checkout":{"footer":{"additional-wording":"By subscribing, you acknowledge and agree that we may adjust the subscription fee in accordance with our <terms>Terms of Service</terms>, in which case we will provide at least 30 days of prior written notice via email and you will be able to cancel your subscription before your next renewal.","bundle-terms":"Promotional benefits may change. By continuing you agree to our <terms>Promotional Bundle Terms and Conditions</terms>.","disclaimer":"You can cancel your subscription any time in your account settings. If you cancel, you will still have access to your %{plan} features, until the end of the current billing period.","preamble":{"free-trial":"<highlight>Your free trial starts today!</highlight> You will not be charged anything for %{n} days. By clicking on the payment button below, you are entering into an <bold>auto-renewing</bold> subscription.","intro-offer":"You will only be charged <highlight>%{intro_price}</highlight> today. By clicking on the payment button below, you are entering into an <bold>auto-renewing</bold> subscription.","no-offer":"By clicking on the payment button below, you are entering into an <bold>auto-renewing</bold> subscription."},"renewal":{"coupon":"Starting <highlight>%{first_renewal_date, datetime}</highlight>, your subscription will automatically renew at <highlight>%{discounted_price} per %{billing}</highlight> until <highlight>%{second_renewal_date, datetime}</highlight>, then at <highlight>%{regular_price} per %{billing}</highlight> until you cancel.","default":"Starting <highlight>%{start_date, datetime}</highlight>, your subscription will automatically renew at <highlight>%{price} per