es have already been downloaded. This won’t change whether or not we email you reminders when people haven’t downloaded your files yet.","cta":"Unsubscribe","title":"“My files have been downloaded, I don’t need emails about expiring transfers”"},"no_email":"you","not_downloaded":{"body":"No problem. You can unsubscribe from reminders that your transfers are about to expire, even though people haven’t downloaded your files yet.","cta":"Unsubscribe","title":"Don’t need emails about expiring transfers?"},"pro":{"body_1":"That’s cool, you can unsubscribe from these reminders. In your transfer details, you’ll still be able to keep track of when transfers expire and change the expiration dates whenever you want.","body_2":"Psst, you can hit us up at <a>subscriptions@wetransfer.com</a> if you change your mind or get stuck with anything—no hard feelings.","cta":"Unsubscribe","title":"Don’t need emails about expiring transfers?"},"title":"Unsubscribe from reminder emails","title_unsubscribed":"All done!"},"unsubscribemarketing":{"button":"Unsubscribe","button_unsubscribed":"Back to WeTransfer","description":"We’ll continue to send you all necessary emails related to your account and transfers, but we’ll exclude any marketing content from now on.","description_unsubscribed":"You won’t receive any more marketing emails.","pro":{"body":"Psst, you can hit us up at <a>subscriptions@wetransfer.com</a> if you change your mind or get stuck with anything—no hard feelings."},"title":"Only send me the essential emails!","title_unsubscribed":"All done!"},"unsubscribeonboarding":{"action":"Unsubscribe","back":"Back to WeTransfer","contact":"Psst, if you get stuck with anything you can hit us up at <a>subscriptions@wetransfer.com</a> — no hard feelings.","done":"All done!","message":"You can unsubscribe from our introduction emails — don’t worry, you’ll still get the important stuff.","title":"Inbox getting busy?"},"userinfo":{"pagename":"Personal details"},"watermark_confirm_modal":{"bod