ame":"One or more files have an empty name. Please rename and try again.","empty_files":"These files are empty, so there\'s nothing to send. Please add files with content and try again.","file_path_too_long":"One or more files are nested in folders so deep that the full path is too long. Please move them closer to the top directory and try again.","filename_too_long":"One or more file names are too long. Please use a shorter name and try again.","firstaccept":"You need to approve first, before sending","generic":"We\'re sorry to say something went wrong during your transfer","has_blackslash":"We can\'t send files whose names include a backslash. Please rename and try again.","has_linebreak":"We can\'t send files whose names include a line break. Please rename and try again.","incorrect_recipient":"It looks like one of the email addresses you entered is incorrect","incorrect_sender":"It looks like there is a problem with your email address","io_error":"There is an issue with your files","long_filename":"We can\'t send files whose names have more than 250 characters. Please rename and try again.","long_message":"That message is a bit too long – please make it shorter","missing_default_recipient":"Only registered WeTransfer Pro email addresses can receive more than %{free_transfer_limit}. Refresh the page to start again.","no_clipboard":"It looks like you haven\'t copied the link","no_files":"It seems you haven\'t added any files yet!","no_folders":"You need to zip/compress your folder before we can send it","no_internet":"Hmm, you\'re not connected to the internet","no_recipient":"We need the email address you want to send these files to","no_sender":"We just need your email address now and we\'re good to go","no_sender_link_transfers":"<b>Your email will not be visible to anyone</b>. We ask it to keep the community safe.","no_sender_link_transfers_revised":"We ask for your email to keep the community safe.","not_downloadable":"Hmm, something went wrong while getting 