ed":"We ask for your email to prevent spam abuse and to keep the community safe.","text_locked_recipient":"Pop in your email and we’ll let you know when your files get downloaded.\\n\\nYou’ll need to verify your email so we know it’s really you.","text_passwordless_login_email":"Pop in your email and we\'ll let you know when your files get downloaded."},"change_type":"Send your transfer link in an email or generate a link to share how you want","contacts":"Anyone you send files to will be automatically added to your contacts","expiry":"With WeTransfer Pro you decide when transfers expire. (You can even change the expiration date after a transfer’s been sent!)","free_limit":"Good news, you can send up to %{size} at a time. Better news, you can use the service as often as you like!","link_transfer":"Did you know you can get your transfer link instead?","message":"If you\'d like, add a message to go with your transfer here","password":"You can password-protect a transfer for added security. Please note we don\'t add the password into the email so you\'ll need to give it to the right people!","prefer_link":{"button":"Get a link","text":"Don’t want to verify your email? That’s okay."},"previews_receiver":"Images sent by Pro users can be previewed before downloading. Just click on a file to see what’s inside!","previews_sender":"Images you send can now be previewed before they\'re downloaded","recipient_limit":"Add up to %{email_limit} emails or open the menu next to the transfer button to create a link","transfer_history":"Your transfer is stored in your transfer overview","vrl_text":"You can now have a look at your files without having to download them.","vrl_title":"Preview your files","your_email":"Pop your own email address in here so we can let you know when your files have been downloaded","zip_text":"Sending a folder? We\'ll zip it for you","zip_title":"No need to zip"},"title":{"previews_receiver":"Introducing image previews","previews_sender":"Introducing image 