re the link and the key. Keep the key safe — it can\'t be recovered.","encrypted_marker":"Encrypted","encryption_key_label":"Encryption key","encryption_key_tooltip":"Losing the key makes the transfer permanently inaccessible, and it can\'t be regenerated. WeTransfer never sees it, so nobody can recover it for you.","preview_text":"See the <progressLink>transfer\'s details,</progressLink> or share through a <qrCodeLink>QR code</qrCodeLink>","preview_text_branded":"See the <progressLink>transfer\'s details</progressLink>","preview_text_no_qr":"See the <progressLink>transfer\'s details.</progressLink>","preview_text_short":"See <progressLink>details</progressLink> or share by <qrCodeLink>QR code</qrCodeLink>.","qr_modal_text":"Scan this QR code with another device to download the transfer.","qrcode_text":"Scan the QR code to download or <a href=\'/transfer/progress\'>see what\'s inside</a>","text":"Copy your download link or <a href=\\"/transfer/progress\\">see what\'s inside</a>","text_copied":"The link has been copied to your clipboard","text_manual_copy":"Your link is ready\\nPress %{shortcut} to copy it to your clipboard","title":"You’re done!"},"complete_mobile":{"email_text":"The transfer email has been sent – your transfer is available for %{expires}","email_text_no_expiry":"An email has been sent to the receiver.","link_text":"Copy your download link:"},"consent-manager":{"art":{"title-small":"Welcome to WeTransfer"},"button-cookies-privacy":"Privacy","trees":{"subtitle":"By accepting our cookies, you directly help us to expand our pledge to the planet. This year alone, WeTransfer has committed to planting over 175,000 trees, and we’re just getting started. You’ll have a positive impact by simply experiencing our award-winning ads. ","title":"Transfer ideas. <b>Transform the world.</b>"}},"cookie-banner":{"button-accept":"Okay","button-decline":"Nope","text":"We use <a>cookies</a> that help the website function, allow us to analyze how our users interact with it, and help us improve it. Do you also want to allow third party cookies so you get personalized advertising?"},"cookie-manager":{"analytical":{"description":"We use analytical cookies to help us understand how you use WeTransfer. They allow us to A/B test new features, ensure that everything is working as it should, and stop bots and malicious behavior like spam. These cookies may include third-party cookies which process personal information. ","title":"Analytical cookies"},"clear":{"clear-all-cookies":"Clear all cookies","description":"You can remove all your data from our cookies. For permanent anonymity requests, please <a href=\\"/help-center\\">contact our support team.</a>","title":"Clear cookies","warning":"You will be signed out of WeTransfer after clearing cookies. This won’t affect transfers on your account."},"functional":{"description":"We use functional cookies to create a seamless experience for you on WeTransfer. They are required to use our Service.","title":"Functional cookies"},"not-yet-set":"It seems like you haven’t given us your cookie preference yet. Please close this panel and set your preference, you can always change it here afterwards.","save-and-reload":"Save settings","tracking":{"description":"We use advertising cookies on our Service to help us measure the success of our commercial, editorial, and promotional efforts. Advertising cookies are not placed on pages that provide information on our brand and products. Advertising cookies allow us to record, for example, that you have clicked on a particular advertisement. If cookies placed by third parties are also placed on other domains and websites, advertisers may be able to follow your behavior across the internet, but WeTransfer cannot access or use any of this personal information that may be collected. As such, we refer you to the privacy policies of the relevant third parties.","title":"Advertising cookies"}},"custom_wallpaper_upsell":{"button":"Upgrade to Premium","text":"Impress your clients by showcasing your work in the background.","title":"Set a unique wallpaper for each transfer"},"details":{"button":{"dismiss":"Dismiss"}},"download":{"back_to_transfer":"Back to transfer","blocked":{"link":"Find out more","text":"This transfer has been reported and can’t be downloaded","title":"Transfer unavailable"},"buttons":{"best_on_mobile":"Best on mobile","download_in_app":"Download in app","open":"Open"},"completed":{"description":"Your files have been successfully downloaded to your computer.","mobile":{"chrome":{"description":"After that, your file will appear in Downloads!","title":"Tap in the bottom bar and proceed with your download"},"default":{"description":"Your files are downloaded on your phone (often in the downloads folder)."},"safari":{"description":"Tap the dot with the arrow in the Safari toolbar to view it.","title":"Your file is in Downloads!"}},"title":"Download completed"},"cookie_text":"We use cookies to give you the best experience. Fear not, we don’t sell your data to third parties. Manage your <a href=\\"https://wetransfer.com/legal/manage-cookies\\" rel=\\"external\\">data preferences</a>.","decryption_unavailable":{"input_label":"Encryption key","input_placeholder":"Encryption key","invalid_key":"That key doesn\'t unlock this transfer. Check it and try again.","text":"Enter the encryption key the sender shared with you to unlock these files.","title":"These files are encrypted","unlock_button":"Decrypt"},"download_link":"Download link","downloaded":{"mobile":{"description":"Once it\'s done, the files will be on your phone (often in the downloads folder).","safari":{"description":"After downloading, your file will appear in Downloads. You can open it directly from the Safari toolbar."}},"text":"Once it\'s done, the files will be on your computer (often in the downloads folder).","title":"Download started"},"encrypted_badge":{"text":"These files are decrypted in your browser, so they can\'t be previewed and they download 