ays}</strong> until your next transfer becomes available.","title":"You’ve uploaded <b>%{used}/%{quota}</b> in the last 30 days. Each transfer stops counting toward your limit 30 days after it was uploaded."},"trustpilot_prompt":{"body":"We\'d love to hear more about what makes WeTransfer valuable to you. Would you consider leaving a review on Trustpilot?","leave_review":"Leave a review","no_thanks":"No thanks","title":"Would you like to share your experience?"},"ultimate_welcome_modal":{"benefits":{"branding":{"description":"Let your transfers speak for you","title":"Branded transfers and emails"},"expiry":{"description":"Don\'t worry about expiration dates","title":"Unlimited transfer expiry"},"limitless":{"description":"No limits on GB and transfers sent","title":"Share and receive limitless"},"malware":{"description":"Download files without worrying","title":"Automatic malware scan"},"recovery":{"description":"Never be afraid of losing your files","title":"Recover expired transfers"}},"close":"Close","cta":"Send your first transfer with Ultimate","hero":{"branding":{"cta":"Customize your brand","description":"Make your brand instantly recognizable with custom background, your personal link, and content on every transfer.","title":"Now you can customize WeTransfer"},"expiry":{"description":"Make your transfers available for one week, one month... Or forever, if you want!","title":"Now you can send transfers with unlimited expiry"},"limits":{"description":"No worries about how many files you share, and on how many GB you send and receive","title":"Now you can use WeTransfer without limits"},"recovery":{"cta":"Go back and recover your expired transfer","description":"Never be afraid of losing your files, or the ones you receive","title":"Now you can recover expired transfers"}},"more_section_title":"And much more! Like...","recovery_in_flow":{"banner":{"branding_cta":"Get started","branding_description":"Let your transfers speak for you","branding_title":"Branded t